mvn, Gradle, ANT


npm - build tool

pom.xml == package.json




mvn validate - validates using pom.xml file
mvn compile - it converts Java -> .class -> jar or war

mvn clean - it removes target folder and its content
mvn package - it validates, compiles and packages it
mvn deploy - it validates, compiles and packages and deploy artifact (*.jar files ) to remote artifact


